    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Now using the formula&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfence